# sunsetscan quotes the strings it searches for in several of its own files.
# That is the textual-matching caveat in action rather than a bug, so the
# self-scan in CI skips them and the rest of the tree must come back clean.
#
#   src/catalog.json  the catalog data itself
#   src/catalog.rs    doc comments and tests that name patterns to explain them
#   src/matcher.rs    boundary tests, whose whole job is matching these literals
#   tests/            fixture repositories built out of real call sites
#   README.md         the catalog table and the worked examples
src/catalog.json
src/catalog.rs
src/matcher.rs
tests/
README.md
